{"id": "EUVD-2026-108327", "enisaUuid": "9ef9bce3-768b-3bba-9b7e-5f23f222be6e", "description": "Wasmtime before 24.0.12, 25.0.0 before 36.0.13, 37.0.0 before 46.0.2, and 47.0.0 before 47.0.3 contains a type confusion vulnerability because several Store APIs fail to validate that objects belong to the Store's Engine. Embedders mixing objects between Engines via Instance::new, StructRefPre::new, or Tag::new can trigger trampoline signature mismatches causing out-of-bounds stack writes, GC heap corruption, or panics.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:59", "baseScore": 1.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:H/AT:P/PR:H/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-hgjw-h833-99q9", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wasmtime-before-24.0.12-25.0.0-before-36.0.13-37.0.0-before-46.0.2-and-47.0.0-before-47.0.3-cross-engine-type-confusion"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115393", "GHSA-hm3j-7f84-9x3r"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "063715a0-ef28-337b-adbb-c21953552a6c", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "25.0.0 <36.0.13"}, {"id": "1a889ed5-3310-3a73-8b33-5734c37b4970", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "0 <24.0.12"}, {"id": "50e589a1-8066-378f-8583-cc9ea94d0d14", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "47.0.0 <47.0.3"}, {"id": "ef4db82e-bcd5-387b-8fcf-f3c04fb0d21c", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "37.0.0 <46.0.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "148dc905-2049-33e0-9d2a-f31e0294a35d", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}], "isExploited": false}